      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Progressing up the medical career ladder is a tough business. Most medical and surgical applications center the requirement for a holistic, balanced individual. As a result, there are usually specific marking criteria in predefined sections. This article provides a guide into what employers are looking for and how best to build your portfolio in these areas."},
